Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:34:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 75/75] Add Spanish translations for eGixium

Translates all new and custom interface strings introduced across the patch series into
Spanish (Castilian and Latin American):

- Incognito screenshots, shake-to-capture gesture, and watermark notifications
- In-browser Task Manager and memory inspector settings
- Navigation gestures, edge swipes, and letter 'C' (Close/Cerrar) gesture preferences
- Safe Shield anti-porn filter, SafeSearch enforcer, and Family DoH preferences
- External download manager settings and chooser
- Adaptive toolbar shortcut note
- Media settings and background video playback toggle
- Video autostart (autoplay) site settings
- Audio context menu download actions
- On-device Developer tools and Inspect element menu items
- About eGixium and toolbar menu accessibility descriptions
- eGixium welcome screen and onboarding options
